## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let reps be parseInt(item 2 of arguments).
Let mutable sum be 0.
Let mutable i be 0.
While i is less than reps:
    Let b be builderWriteString(newBuilder(), "abcdefgh").
    Set sum to sum + length of builderBytes(b).
    Set i to i + 1.
Show sum.
